{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Pisces (Revised)","paragraph":1565,"wording":"[Rapist]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"Pisces","holder-quote":"Tenir heard that. His face turned hostile instantly.","id":"6203bc3b-4efe-5ca9-bfac-26ad17e24190"}
{"chapter-slug":"rwInterlude - Pisces (Revised)","paragraph":1568,"wording":"[Rapist]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"Tenir","holder-quote":"Pisces raised his voice. Tenir reacted even more than he had hoped. The man’s eyes opened wide in genuine fury—he really believed he was innocent.","id":"ca0f5524-d704-5d27-bbac-f798056d0a95"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw10-68 S","paragraph":2454,"wording":"[Rapist]","event":"named","holder-slug":"jourteben-rabeis","holder-quote":"So the [Rapist], Jourteben Rabeis, just licked his lips and smiled","id":"f1dc188f-0733-53c2-9555-bb4bb712fba3"}
